  "Configure sensitivity for key presses and releases independently.": "分别设置按下和松开的灵敏度。",
  "Deactivates Rapid Trigger only when the key is fully released, instead of at the actuation point.": "仅在按键完全松开时停用快速触发，而非在触发行程处停用。",
  "Enable this option to register both key presses when keys are fully pressed simultaneously, bypassing the resolution behavior.": "启用后，当两个按键同时触底时，同时触发两个按键，忽略互斥处理规则。",
  "Immediately perform the hold action if another non-Tap-Hold key is pressed.": "按下其他非轻点 / 长按按键时，立即执行长按动作。",
  "Manage your keyboard profiles here. You can import, export, and customize them.": "在此管理键盘配置方案，可导入、导出和自定义。",
  "No active advanced keys...": "尚未启用高级按键…",
  "No gamepad analog input will be sent.": "不发送手柄模拟输入。",
  "No macro actions...": "尚无宏动作…",
  "Rapid Trigger is automatically disabled for Dynamic Keystroke keys.": "动态键程（DKS）按键会自动禁用快速触发。",
  "Remove the circular boundaries of the joystick for full range of motion.": "移除摇杆的圆形边界，以使用完整的移动范围。",
  "Select how Null Bind resolves key presses when both keys are pressed simultaneously.": "选择同时按下两个按键时，双键互斥的处理方式。",
  "Set the actuation point at which Null Bind becomes active.": "设置启用双键互斥的触发行程。",
  "Set the actuation point at which the key is considered fully pressed.": "设置将按键视为完全按下的行程。",
  "Set the actuation point for \"Key fully pressed\" and \"Key released from fully pressed\" actions.": "设置“按键完全按下”和“按键从触底松开”动作的触发行程。",
  "Set the actuation point for \"Key press\" and \"Key release\" actions.": "设置“按下”和“松开”动作的触发行程。",
  "Set the duration the key must be held to perform the hold action.": "设置执行长按动作所需的持续按住时间。",
  "Set the duration the key must be held to perform the normal key behavior.": "设置执行普通按键行为所需的持续按住时间。",
  "Set the minimum distance change required for Rapid Trigger to register a key release.": "设置快速触发识别松开动作所需的最小行程变化。",
  "The keyboard will disconnect and reconnect. No changes will be made to your keyboard settings.": "键盘将断开并重新连接，不会更改键盘设置。",
  "The keyboard will restart and enter bootloader mode if it is supported by the firmware. No changes will be made to your keyboard settings.": "若固件支持，键盘将重启并进入 Bootloader 模式，不会更改键盘设置。",
  "Revert the keyboard to its factory settings defined by the firmware. All user data and settings will be lost.": "将键盘恢复为固件定义的出厂设置。所有用户数据和设置都将丢失。",
  "Allow your keyboard to be recognized as an Xbox controller for gamepad input. Restart the keyboard to apply changes. This setting applies globally across all profiles.": "允许将键盘识别为 Xbox 控制器，以发送手柄输入。重启键盘后生效，此设置适用于所有配置方案。",
  "Enable the 8000Hz polling rate for faster response times, but may increase the CPU usage of the host device. Restart the keyboard to apply changes. This setting applies globally across all profiles.": "启用 8000 Hz 轮询率以缩短响应时间，但可能增加主机 CPU 占用。重启键盘后生效，此设置适用于所有配置方案。",
  "Enable Rapid Trigger to compare keys only when Rapid Trigger registers a key press. Additional Rapid Trigger options are available in the Performance tab.": "启用后，仅在快速触发识别到按下动作时比较按键。其他快速触发选项位于“性能”页面。",
  "Rapid Trigger registers key presses and releases based on changes in key distance rather than absolute position. It activates and deactivates at the actuation point.": "快速触发根据行程变化识别按下和松开，而非固定位置；在触发行程处启用或停用。",
  "Assign bindings using the menu on the right. For a tap action, click the plus icon once. For a hold action, click the plus icon and drag it to the desired key position based on your preferred behavior.": "使用右侧菜单分配绑定。轻点动作只需点击一次加号；长按动作需按住加号，并按预期行为拖动到相应的按键位置。",
  "Create a sequence of actions to be triggered when the key is pressed. Assign bindings for each action using the menu on the right.": "创建按下按键时执行的动作序列，使用右侧菜单为每个动作分配绑定。",
  "Maximum gamepad analog input will be sent. For joysticks, the angle will snap to the nearest 45 degree, functioning similar to a D-Pad.": "发送最大手柄模拟输入。摇杆方向将吸附到最近的 45 度方向，效果类似方向键。",
  "Modify how keyboard analog values translate to gamepad analog inputs. You can manually adjust the analog curve or select a preset from below. These settings affect both joysticks and triggers.": "调整键盘模拟值转换为手柄模拟输入的方式。可手动调整曲线或选择下方预设，此设置同时影响摇杆和扳机。",
  "Periodically save the per-key bottom-out threshold values after some inactivity to be restored on next boot. The saved values will only be cleared on recalibration. This setting applies globally across all profiles.": "在一段时间无操作后定期保存各按键的触底阈值，以便下次启动恢复。仅重新校准会清除保存值，此设置适用于所有配置方案。",
  "The initial bottom out threshold represents the estimated change in analog value when a key is fully pressed. It should be set slightly lower than the actual change in analog readings when keys are fully pressed to prevent deadzones. Recalibrate the keyboard to apply changes. This setting applies globally across all profiles.": "初始触底阈值表示按键完全按下时模拟值的预估变化量。应略低于实际触底时的变化量，以避免死区。重新校准后生效，此设置适用于所有配置方案。",
  "The initial noise floor represents the estimated analog value when a key is at rest. It should be set slightly higher than the actual analog readings of all keys in their resting position to prevent deadzones. Recalibrate the keyboard to apply changes. This setting applies globally across all profiles.": "初始噪声基线表示按键静止时的预估模拟值。应略高于所有按键静止时的实际读数，以避免死区。重新校准后生效，此设置适用于所有配置方案。",
  "The tick rate determines the delay between two consecutive actions performed by Advanced Keys. For example, a tap action performs a key press and release consecutively. A lower tick rate means less delay, but may result in missed inputs if the game or application cannot keep up with processing the inputs.": "动作间隔决定高级按键两个连续动作之间的延迟。例如轻点会依次执行按下和松开。较低的值可减少延迟，但若游戏或应用处理不及时，可能导致漏输入。",
  "The tick rate is per profile and only affects Dynamic Keystroke, Tap-Hold, and Macro keys.": "动作间隔按配置方案独立设置，仅影响动态键程、轻点 / 长按和宏按键。",
  "This tab requests data from the keyboard at a high frequency, which may impact performance. Please close this tab or switch to another one when performing other performance-sensitive tasks with your keyboard.": "此页面会高频读取键盘数据，可能影响性能。使用键盘执行对性能敏感的任务时，请关闭或切换此页面。",
  "Use the maximum analog value between opposite joystick axes instead of combining them for more responsive movement.": "对相反摇杆方向取较大的模拟值，而非合并两个值，使移动更灵敏。",
